10. She enjoys Shrek references and has considered releasing a Shrek-themed music album. (Verbatim: "I should just release the elia shrek album to be honest.") [end of text]



1. She has a strong affinity for the Shrek soundtrack, considering it a "banger." (Verbatim: "you know the soundtrack for shrek is a banger")
